          </li>
          <li>
            <h4>{% routeLink "/locations/wholesale-trading/", "Wholesale and trading markets" %}</h4>
            <p class="delhi-places">Such as Sadar Bazaar, Khari Baoli and Gandhi Nagar</p>
            <p>High purchase and sales volumes, supplier credit, party ledgers and matching GST records.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
